        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>乙 女 x 轻 喜 剧 x 吻</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/ad39cec1dc5916964f08f8bf59725bca.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/ad39cec1dc5916964f08f8bf59725bca.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >平凡的社畜佘楚楚（姓名可更改）工作日晚上团建结束时，在路边被酒驾车辆撞到身亡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本以为会去直接投胎的她，却被死神告知，这场车祸可能是地府宿命系统运行错误导致的乌龙。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地府查清错误大概需要20天的时间，在这期间，佘楚楚可以继续留在人间，但必须要依附生者而活。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每过72小时，佘楚楚必须要与依附者亲吻获得对方的“生者之气”，否则便会提前魂飞魄散。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >俗话说得好——“好死不如赖活着”，为了能够撑到查清事故的那天，不管是前男友还是白月光，亦或是路过的陌生美青年，逮到哪个是哪个，她佘楚楚（姓名可更改）都不会放过。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/3cd79db4d308535da5287df071aafff1.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/3cd79db4d308535da5287df071aafff1.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=1922 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/0a45f74786578292f2447369481f1833.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/0a45f74786578292f2447369481f1833.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/71ed2df186eb9267fed148e166724ac0.avif?t=1787211314\" width=768 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作的主人公，普通社畜一枚，于工作日晚团建后不幸遭遇车祸身亡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但是当主人公再睁开眼睛时，前来接引她的死神告知这场事故可能是意外。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在地府调查清楚前，需要主人公在人间寄生在活人身上20天，而寄生的办法则是嘴对嘴汲取活人的“生气”，还必须每72小时一次。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >光想就令人头大。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“把团建定在工作日晚上的主管都应该被抓起来！”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/be9947668a1255f9fcd54a94a04f64ec.avif?t=1787211314\" width=768 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【大学时期交往两年的前男友】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因为曾经的分手并不愉快，因此主人公本来并没有将贺一晗作为亲吻续命的备选。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >然而阴差阳错之下，二人仍然产生了交集。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一场拉扯与试探的情感纠葛再次拉开帷幕。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“记住，我们已经分手了！”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/cc3fadb26d4872e0723525319d3f6ac9.avif?t=1787211314\" width=768 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【陌生的美少年】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主人公在朋友公司楼下偶遇的（看着就家世不凡的）美少年。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >死神给予主人公选择亲吻续命对象的时间有限，主人公再度濒死之时，求生的意志令她不得已选择了这个完全不知道任何信息的青年。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为了活下去，主人公也只能硬着头皮，想办法得到这个毒舌小子的青睐。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“帮不帮你我都没有损失，那么我为什么要做慈善？”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/3fa30e34aa0bf631d844cd495762ff30.avif?t=1787211314\" width=768 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【喜爱并憧憬的小提琴家】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >出于最坏的情况考虑，主人公的生命或许只剩下20天，因此主人公鼓起勇气决定去见一直以来憧憬的偶像。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >却没想到外表看似清冷孤傲的男人实际上极为好说话，于是主人公做了一个大胆的决定……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“你会变成这样，我有不可推卸的责任”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/54c998738694600c1b7fa20c5b7a8ad1.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/54c998738694600c1b7fa20c5b7a8ad1.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作组：爱的氧气罐制作组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主策/剧本/演出：清柠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色/CG原画：坏坏伏伏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI/美宣：Q布</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >程序：咕咕</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/d0363fac79b531b69ef0e9a9c40f16b5.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/d0363fac79b531b69ef0e9a9c40f16b5.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本游戏类型为视觉小说（AVD/ADV）。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >即通过阅读文字剧情，通过选项进行选择，推动故事情节产生分支的冒险游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（注：本游戏所有可攻略男角色均已成年）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/76c8c1a6fc7bed423207f540541aa060.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/76c8c1a6fc7bed423207f540541aa060.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span>【游戏试玩版（demo）】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >资源QQ群：107544106（具体见群文件）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（注：试玩版内容不代表正式版内容，仅供参考）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【微博ID】：爱的氧气罐工作室</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【小红书ID】：爱的氧气罐制作组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【B站ID】：爱的氧气罐制作组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宝宝们可以关注这些平台获得后续游戏内容~</p>",
