_paragraph\" >出于最坏的情况考虑，主人公的生命或许只剩下20天，因此主人公鼓起勇气决定去见一直以来憧憬的偶像。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >却没想到外表看似清冷孤傲的男人实际上极为好说话，于是主人公做了一个大胆的决定……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“你会变成这样，我有不可推卸的责任”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/54c998738694600c1b7fa20c5b7a8ad1.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/54c998738694600c1b7fa20c5b7a8ad1.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作组：爱的氧气罐制作组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主策/剧本/演出：清柠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色/CG原画：坏坏伏伏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI/美宣：Q布</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >程序：咕咕</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/d0363fac79b531b69ef0e9a9c40f16b5.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/d0363fac79b531b69ef0e9a9c40f16b5.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本游戏类型为视觉小说（AVD/ADV）。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >即通过阅读文字剧情，通过选项进行选择，推动故事情节产生分支的冒险游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（注：本游戏所有可攻略男角色均已成年）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras/76c8c1a6fc7bed423207f540541aa060.avif?t=1787211314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617040/extras_big/76c8c1a6fc7bed423207f540541aa060.avif?t=1787211314 width=800 height=84 /></span>【游戏试玩版（demo）】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >资源QQ群：107544106（具体见群文件）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（注